asense (0.4.0-1~local1) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Repair mode-only/ENXIO fan discovery and re-discover hardware before writes.
  * Serve bounded concurrent control clients while preserving Manual ownership,
    thermal watchdogs and disconnect recovery.
  * Add evidence-bounded AN17-51, AN14-41 and AN16-51 lighting variants with
    canonical write/readback policy and native C regression coverage.
  * Correct Acer profile labels and passive schema-4 diagnostics, including
    descriptor-only Darfon USB discovery and legacy schema-3 report reading.
  * Preserve unknown telemetry/control state and report absent fan recovery
    separately from verified Auto. Keep source, DKMS and Arch metadata aligned.

